<title>USA: Hammond San. Dist., Ind., won by City Securities.</title>
<headline>Hammond San. Dist., Ind., won by City Securities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>City Securities Inc. said it won $2 million of Hammond Sanitary District, Ind., special taxing district bonds, Series 1997 B, with a net interest cost of 5.74 percent.</p>
</text>
